        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">injured patient</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">The following definition for &apos;injured patient&apos; was approved by the CAFE team of domain experts (experts in trauma care) May 29, 2015.

