        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">An organization that has other organizations as parts and that rovides emergency medical care. Once it is activated through the report of  an incident that causes serious illness or injury, the focus of EMS is emergency medical care of the patient.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000117 xml:lang="en">Mathias Brochhausen</obo:IAO_0000117>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="en">EMS</obo:IAO_0000118>
