        <obo:IAO_0000119 xml:lang="en">American College of Surgions TCOT. National Trauma Data Standard Data Dictionary [Internet]. 2024. https://www.facs.org/media/k4wnvapp/final_2024-data-dictionary-830.pdf</obo:IAO_0000119>
